# Workflow source checksums and release receipts identify exact file bytes.
# Preserve those bytes across Windows/Linux checkouts; editors may retain the
# existing line endings. This does not disable ordinary text diffs.
* -text

# CRLF is a line ending, not trailing whitespace. Keep normal whitespace checks.
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
